<mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">\u2061</mo><mi>\u03b8</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>\u2212</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>25</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">\u2061</mo><mi>\u03b8</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">\u2061</mo><mi>\u03b8</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>25</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>\u2212</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>25</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>\u2212</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Here, the hyperbola <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"355\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>\u2212</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> represents the intersection of our hyperboloid with the plane that passes through the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"356\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis and makes the angle of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"357\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>\u03b8</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> with the positive <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"358\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis. Using the hint, a parametrization of such hyperbola can be given as\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_c